# The ring 3 probe: the kernel self-tests' demonstration program. Its
# CSpace is bespoke -- built by the tests to show grants, refusals and
# revocation working -- and this manifest states that shape truthfully:
# a badged console, one page held strong and weak, a read-only window
# on device registers, a notification held with read and with write,
# and one directory of the filesystem, nothing above it.
package probe
version 0.1.0

program bin/probe
entry hertz
cap endpoint console
cap memory pages=1
cap device-registers
cap notification
cap directory

payload bin/probe from user/probe/target/x86_64-unknown-none/release/probe
